                   <tr><td class="td5">Life is beautiful / BEMANI Sound Team "猫叉Master"</td></tr>
                   <tr><td class="td5">風鈴花火 / BEMANI Sound Team "劇団レコード"feat.結良まり</td></tr>
                   <tr><td class="td5">Puberty Dysthymia / BEMANI Sound Team "person09"</td></tr>
                   <tr><td class="td5">Prey / BEMANI Sound Team "Dustup"</td></tr>
                   <tr><td class="td5">Rejoin / BEMANI Sound Team "HuΣeR feat.PON"</td></tr>
                </table>
              <br />
